description.content:
Search for catalog items using a Filter DSL for complex boolean queries.
This endpoint accepts a JSON body with the filter parameter for advanced filtering.

## Filter DSL

The filter parameter supports:
- Comparison operators: eq, ne, in, not_in, gt, gte, lt, lte, between
- Boolean operators: and, or (with nesting up to 5 levels)

## Allowed Fields

- brand_id, category_id, tag_id, item_type_id, catalog_item_id (integers)
- fulfillment_type (string: "physical", "digital")
- price (number), points (integer)

## Example Filter

```json
{
  "filter": {
    "and": [
      {"eq": {"category_id": 10493}},
      {"or": [
        {"eq": {"brand_id": 5984}},
        {"eq": {"brand_id": 114}}
      ]},
      {"between": {"price": [50, 200]}}
    ]
  }
}
```

